<title>USA: Tenneco to issue $300 mln in two-part debt.</title>
<headline>Tenneco to issue $300 mln in two-part debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenneco Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $300 million two-part debt offering next week, dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to include $100 million in 10-year notes and $200 million in 30-year debt, dealers added.</p>
<p>Both issues are expected to include a make-whole call provision, they said.</p>
<p>The Baa1/BBB rated deal is expected to be underwritten by Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, they added.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
